                <invention-title lang="de">UNIVERSELLE DIGITALE KARTE (UDC) ZUR VERWENDUNG ALS DIGITALE SPENDERKARTE ODER DIGITALE VERTEILUNGSKARTE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">CARTE NUMÉRIQUE UNIVERSELLE (UDC) DESTINÉE À ÊTRE UTILISÉE COMME CARTE DONNEUSE NUMÉRIQUE OU CARTE DE DISTRIBUTION NUMÉRIQUE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">UNIVERSAL DIGITAL CARD (UDC) FOR USE AS DIGITAL DONOR CARD OR DIGITAL DISTRIBUTION CARD</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A universal digital card, UDC (122) for use in a node of a distributed antenna system, DAS (100), the UDC (122) comprising: an external digital interface (124) to communicatively couple the UDC (122) to an external communication link used to transmit and receive data in any of a plurality of different external interface formats; and wherein the UDC (122) is configured to: receive data formatted according to any of the plurality of external interface formats from the external communication link via the external digital interface; communicate data formatted according to any of the plurality of external interface formats over the external communication link via the external digital interface; and wherein the UDC (122) is configured to be selectively used either as: a donor card to communicatively couple the node to one or more base station entities (108) via the external digital interface; or a distribution card to communicatively couple the node to one or more non-DAS nodes, hubs, switches, or remote radio heads or one or more other DAS nodes or access points.</p>
            </abstract>
